{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":89866,\"title\":\"Christina on the Coast\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Christina Anstead expands her design business in Southern California, transforming clients' outdated properties into high-end showplaces. Also spotlighted is her personal journey after her split from ex-husband Tarek.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8yEiua44hgLBxQQSN7r6GOAxBC7.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nBB2L8lFX2gzZ6Mxg8YgWFMxWCW.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":4.7,\"voteCount\":6,\"year\":2019,\"genres\":[\"Reality\"],\"status\":\"Returning Series\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":6,\"totalEpisodes\":61,\"createdBy\":[],\"networks\":[\"HGTV\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2025-03-13\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1586429,\"name\":\"Christina Hall\",\"character\":\"Self - Host\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eZ18h8V6UWxPiSI0nJY3dof7Kav.jpg\"}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"ULoHjG-ueWw\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"BBhsWl1lBFM\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"9u8o1LQY94E\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[],\"seasonNumber\":5,\"seasonName\":\"Season 5\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/br2WVQXvjG4182Q8nOV1dLYE8FZ.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2022-12-08\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"A New Outlook\",\"overview\":\"As Christina settles with Josh and the kids into a new home, she and James catch up and get back to work; their first project is transforming a couple's cramped, outdated kitchen and dining room into an open space for recharging and entertaining.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7DvG6NzaoCBJUTwz5Bu4n46gOWk.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-12-08\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"More of the Warm Hug Home\",\"overview\":\"Christina and James revisit clients who want to carry the Zen vibe into the rest of their home by renovating both of their bathrooms. Also, a pool party finds Christina plotting the perfect outdoor retreat for contractor Mike and his family.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hMfpPxSeNNAcsvnpmloPpuNlbNt.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-12-15\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Put Another Dime in the Jukebox\",\"overview\":\"Christina and James help clients revamp their kitchen, living space and two bathrooms to better suit their growing family and give a fresh, beachy feel to their coastal home. Meanwhile, Christina and Josh find the home of their dreams in Newport Beach.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iFzdLufKkksRIMFOszwfrVzm1Vd.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-12-22\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Big Family, Tiny Kitchen\",\"overview\":\"Grade-school sweethearts enlist Christina's help to expand their tiny kitchen into an indoor-outdoor entertainment space for the entire extended family. Also, Christina prepares to take a leap, expand business, and take on design clients in Tennessee.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/53YhK9J5e1TSZNM64SFaT9bZqMM.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-12-29\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Outgrowing Old Spaces\",\"overview\":\"Christina helps Amy and Scott transform their home to better serve their active family of five. Christina's best friend Cassie, and husband James, reveal an important detail of expanding their own family at their daughter Jules' first birthday party.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AqNfrLe0DpKIXhI1xi9p37l9JKQ.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-06-29\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"A Dog's Life\",\"overview\":\"Christina helps fellow French Bulldog parents, Danny and Nicole, create a living space perfectly suited for entertaining their two and four-legged friends. With the help of a pet communicator, Christina and Josh create a deeper bond with their dogs.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8Ma1L0gU671hraBswrXQBgk03uQ.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-07-06\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Vacation Vibes\",\"overview\":\"Christina helps Terri and Sam create a five-star resort style primary bedroom that includes a bathroom doubled in size and converting a room into a spacious walk-in closet. And to save on budget, James and Christina create a DIY shiplap accent wall.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/w4Vs3sHknfTW0aujijEUbhDkaPM.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-07-13\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Delays for Days\",\"overview\":\"Christina helps couple Leanna and Chis renovate their 1970s-style bedroom into a peaceful space to unwind after a busy day. With unforeseen delays, Christina puts in the extra effort to make sure this family receives the full Zen they deserve.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7bqOmN1BwQzfHbvtAoSVhczpVWZ.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-07-20\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Taking the Plunge\",\"overview\":\"As homeowners Jon and Lindsay take on two renovations at once, Christina ensures the living area and kitchen match the updated pool and outdoor space. With wellness in mind, Christina and Josh update their own backyard by adding a sauna and ice plunge.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iN3G98TbhX0kpihMV4TSyWisbeo.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-07-27\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Friendship for Ages\",\"overview\":\"Christina gets a call from childhood friend Carlos and his wife Natalie who need to revamp their kitchen, bathroom, fireplace and bar to make the house cohesive. Also, Christina's daughter, Taylor, is getting older and ready for a more grown up style.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eCp2qCfKBeQ7UdZCyJKQEU5Yv2v.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-08-03\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Renew for the Ocean View\",\"overview\":\"Homeowners Shawn and Michael want Christina's help to transform their outdated coastal home into a modern-day retreat. Christina takes on remodeling the kitchen and living area so that Shawn and Michael can make the most out of their gorgeous ocean view.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gKRCkF4dhVFqAx9lO0wie1KPrvf.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-08-10\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Every Foot Counts\",\"overview\":\"Christina helps homeowners Jenny and Tobias renovate their cramped house for their family of five. While it has a stunning view, the home needs a functional layout. Meanwhile, Christina and James have quality time together while Josh is in Tennessee.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eSC08E1MUwCsGAq4DsFebPy3Q30.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-08-17\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"Always Upgrading\",\"overview\":\"Christina helps Teri and Bradley transform their family home of almost 30 years into a modern coastal retreat. Meanwhile, Christina and Josh begin the process of upgrading their automated kitchen into a warmer, more functional space for their family.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9npkTbhIa0yes0WWrfNCGfcl83z.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-08-24\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":14,\"name\":\"The 16 Year Kitchen\",\"overview\":\"Engineers Cliff and Nadine have been planning their renovation for over 15 years, and they need Christina to help bring the vision of their kitchen and living room into reality. At home, Christina and Josh complete the renovation of their own kitchen.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pkLCjVT1uizU0qrVSxnmrnSZRAy.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-08-31\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":15,\"name\":\"New Bathroom, New Baby\",\"overview\":\"Repeat clients mean happy clients, so Christina's excited to update Gina and Eric's primary bathroom to match the reno on their kitchen. Also, Christina's friend Cassie has a baby on the way and enlists her help to convert a spare bedroom into a nursery.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yvGPtJrlcddQAJaKKrrtB2QlfS6.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-09-07\",\"runtime\":0}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2019-05-23\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}